my.com.br/site-demo/dra-lara-costa\n   165→- **Verification**:\n   166→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n   167→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n   168→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n   169→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n   170→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   171→\n   172→**Learnings:**\n   173→- **Pattern**: Serene Sage & Pearl palette creates a fresh, natural aesthetic that differentiates from the rose/gold warmth of US-048 while maintaining premium positioning\n   174→- **Pattern**: Dual organic border-radius patterns (`--radius-organic` and `--radius-organic-2`) create more dynamic blob animations when combined with keyframe transforms\n   175→- **Pattern**: Gradient avatars for testimonials add visual interest and reinforce the color scheme\n   176→- **Gotcha**: The sage-green palette feels more modern and contemporary while still being feminine and elegant\n   177→- **Gotcha**: Playfair Display + Inter font pairing is slightly more modern/readable than Cormorant Garamond + Montserrat\n   178→- **Gotcha**: Adding 4th blob with lower opacity creates additional depth without overwhelming the design\n   179→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   180→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens\n   181→\n   182→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n   183→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-sage-dark: #7FA68C`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic\n   184→- **Dual Organic Border Radius**: `--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%` and `--radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%` for more dynamic blob animations\n   185→- **Pulsing Ring Animation**: CSS animation on differential icons creates subtle attention-grabb