{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209014253f81a0df7c51b407c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Design Specification for Dra Iara Pengo - Onyx Noir & Bronze Patina\n\n### Color Palette\n```css\n--color-onyx: #1A1A1A\n--color-onyx-deep: #0F0F12\n--color-bronze: #A67C52\n--color-bronze-light: #B88D62\n--color-bronze-dark: #8A5C42\n--color-bronze-patina: #9A6C52\n--color-verdigris: #4A6B6A\n--color-verdigris-light: #5A7B7A\n--color-verdigris-dark: #3A5B5A\n--color-ivory-antique: #F8F6F2\n--color-ivory-warm: #F3F1EA\n--color-sand: #E8E4DC\n```\n\n### Typography\n- **Display**: Cormorant Garamond (elegant serif with classical qualities)\n- **Body**: Space Grotesk (modern geometric sans-serif)\n\n### Border Radius Patterns (Patina Shard Shapes)\n```css\n--radius-patina-1: 68% 32% 52% 48% / 52% 38% 62% 48%\n--radius-patina-2: 48% 52% 62% 38% / 42% 58% 42% 58%\n--radius-patina-3: 58% 42% 48% 52% / 52% 48% 52% 48%\n--radius-patina-4: 42% 58% 52% 48% / 48% 52% 48% 52%\n```\n\n### Site Structure\n1. **Hero Section**: Dramatic entrance with animated patina shards, value proposition\n2. **Problem/Solution**: Story-based narrative with hover effects\n3. **Services**: 6 cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n4. **Testimonials**: 3 client testimonials on verdigris background\n5. **Differentials**: 6 key differentiators with pulsing icons\n6. **Contact**: Form with WhatsApp integration\n7. **Footer**: Minimalist with essential info\n\n### Contact Information\n- **Address**: Av. Sen. César Vergueiro, 480 - sala 20 - Jardim Irajá, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14020-510\n- **Phone**: (16) 99227-7033\n\nLet me proceed with implementation."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57327177-47df-4025-ad57-6e32ca13aeb8","uuid":"270b5217-7fc0-4eb0-8e5f-6b2a81a0d544"}
