     </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"message\" class=\"form-label\">Mensagem</label>\n                        <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" class=\"form-textarea\" placeholder=\"Conte-nos sobre suas expectativas...\" required></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"form-submit\">\n                        Enviar Mensagem\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-left: 0.5rem;\">\n                            <line x1=\"22\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"11\" y2=\"13\"/>\n                            <polygon points=\"22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n                <h3>Dra Iara Pengo</h3>\n                <p>Transformando vidas através da harmonização facial e estética avançada em Ribeirão Preto.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-links\">\n                <h4>Links Rápidos</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"#home\">Início</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Serviços</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#depoimentos\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#contato\">Contato</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-links\">\n                <h4>Serviços</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Harmonização Facial</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Toxina Botulínica</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Preenchedores</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Bioestimuladores</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n            <p>&copy; 2026 Dra Iara Pengo. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>\n            <div class=\"footer-social\">\n                <a href=\"https://instagram.com\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\"/>\n                        <path d=\"M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z\"/>\n                        <line x1=\"17.5\" y1=\"6.5\" x2=\"17.51\" y2=\"6.5\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"https://facebook.com\" aria-label=\"Facebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path d=\"M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/5516992277033\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // ============================================\n        // NAVIGATION BEHAVIOR\n        // ============================================\n        let lastScroll = 0;\n        const nav = document.getElementById('nav');\n        const navToggle = document.getElementById('navToggle');\n        const navMenu = document.getElementById('navMenu');\n\n        // Auto-hide navigation on scroll\n        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {\n            const currentScroll = window.pageYOffset;\n\n            if (currentScroll > lastScroll && currentScroll > 100) {\n                nav.classList.add('hidden');\n            } else {\n                nav.classList.remove('hidden');\n            }\n            lastScroll = currentScroll;\n        });\n\n        // Mobile menu toggle\n        navToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            navMenu.classList.toggle('active');\n        });\n\n        // Close mobile menu when clicking on a link\n        navMenu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => {\n            link.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                navMenu.classList.remove('active');\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Keyboard navigation for menu toggle\n        navToggle.addEventListener('keypress', (e) => {\n            if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                navMenu.classList.toggle('active');\n            }\n        });\n\n        // ============================================\n        // SMOOTH SCROLL\n        // ============================================\n        document.querySelectorAll('a[href^=\"#\"]').forEach(anchor => {\n            anchor.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                const target = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href'));\n                if (target) {\n                    const navHeight = nav.offsetHeight;\n                    const targetPosition = target.offsetTop - navHeight;\n                    window.scrollTo({\n                        top: targetPosition,\n                        behavior: 'smooth'\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ============================================\n        // INTERSECTION OBSERVER FOR ANIMATIONS\n        // ============================================\n        const observerOptions = {\n            threshold: 0.1,\n            rootMargin: '0px 0px -50px 0px'\n        };\n\n        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n            entries.forEach(entry => {\n                if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                    const delay = entry.target.dataset.delay || 0;\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n                    }, delay);\n                    observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n                }\n            });\n        }, observerOptions);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.wow-fade-up').forEach(el => {\n            observer.observe(el);\n        });\n\n        // ============================================\n        // CONTACT FORM - WHATSAPP INTEGRATION\n        // ============================================\n        const contactForm = document.getElementById('contactForm');\n\n        contactForm.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n            e.preventDefault();\n\n            const name = document.getElementById('name').value;\n            const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value;\n            const service = document.getElementById('service').value;\n            const message = document.getElementById('message').value;\n\n            const whatsappMessage = `Olá! Meu nome é ${name}.\\n\\nTelefone: ${phone}\\nServiço de interesse: ${service}\\n\\nMensagem: ${message}`;\n\n            const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/5516992277033?text=${encodeURIComponent(whatsappMessage)}`;\n\n            window.open(whatsappUrl, '_blank');\n\n            // Optional: Show success feedback\n            contactForm.reset();\n            alert('Mensagem enviada! Você será redirecionado para o WhatsApp.');\n        });\n\n        // ============================================\n        // PARALLAX EFFECT FOR BLOBS\n        // ============================================\n        const heroSection = document.querySelector('.hero');\n        const blobs = document.querySelectorAll('.blob');\n\n        if (window.innerWidth > 768) {\n            heroSection.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 20;\n                const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 20;\n\n                blobs.forEach((blob, index) => {\n                    const speed = (index + 1) * 0.5;\n                    blob.style.transform = `translate(${x * speed}px, ${y * speed}px)`;\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        // ============================================\n        // REDUCED MOTION CHECK\n        // ============================================\n        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');\n\n        if (prefersReducedMotion.matches) {\n            blobs.forEach(blob => {\n                blob.style.animation = 'none';\n            });\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57327177-47df-4025-ad57-6e32ca13aeb8","uuid":"def149c4-d185-4dd0-b379-dcbc8dc58150"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_3f2cfa848adc450f81f4bc33","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/dra-iara-pengo/index.html"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57327177-47df-4025-ad57-6e32ca13aeb8","uuid":"996f1f12-df3c-4408-9e17-0f3cbe08fe08","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/dra-iara-pengo/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dra Iara Pengo | Harmonização Facial e Estética Avançada em Ribeirão Preto</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dra Iara Pengo - Atendimento especializado em harmonização facial e estética avançada em Ribeirão Preto. Transforme sua aparência com tratamentos personalizados.\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        /* ============================================\n           ONYX NOIR & BRONZE PATINA PALETTE\n           Classical elegance with timeless beauty\n        ============================================ */\n        :root {\n            /* Primary Colors */\n            --color-onyx: #1A1A1A;\n            --color-onyx-deep: #0F0F12;\n            --color-bronze: #A67C52;\n            --color-bronze-light: #B88D62;\n            --color-bronze-dark: #8A5C42;\n            --color-bronze-patina: #9A6C52;\n            --color-verdigris: #4A6B6A;\n            --color-verdigris-light: #5A7B7A;\n            --color-verdigris-dark: #3A5B5A;\n            --color-verdigris-deep: #2A4B4A;\n            --color-ivory-antique: #F8F6F2;\n            --color-ivory-warm: #F3F1EA;\n            --color-sand: #E8E4DC;\n            --color-sand-light: #F0ECE6;\n\n            /* Typography */\n            --font-display: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;\n            --font-body: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n\n            /* Spacing */\n            --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n            --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n            --spacing-md: 1.5rem;\n            --spacing-lg: 2rem;\n            --spacing-xl: 3rem;\n            --spacing-2xl: 4rem;\n            --spacing-3xl: 6rem;\n\n            /* Border Radius - Patina Shard Shapes */\n            --radius-patina-1: 68% 32% 52% 48% / 52% 38% 62% 48%;\n            --radius-patina-2: 48% 52% 62% 38% / 42% 58% 42% 58%;\n            --radius-patina-3: 58% 42% 48% 52% / 52% 48% 52% 48%;\n            --radius-patina-4: 42% 58% 52% 48% / 48% 52% 48% 52%;\n            --radius-sm: 4px;\n            --radius-md: 8px;\n            --radius-lg: 12px;\n\n            /* Transitions */\n            --transition-fast: 0.2s ease;\n            --transition-base: 0.3s ease;\n            --transition-slow: 0.5s ease;\n\n            /* Shadows */\n            --shadow-sm: 0 2px 4px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.08);\n            --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.12);\n            --shadow-lg: 0 8px 24px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.16);\n            --shadow-xl: 0 12px 32px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           RESET & BASE STYLES\n        ============================================ */\n        *, *::before, *::after {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: var(--color-onyx);\n            background-color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        ul {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        button {\n            font-family: inherit;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            border: none;\n            background: none;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           TYPOGRAPHY\n        ============================================ */\n        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            color: var(--color-onyx);\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            color: var(--color-onyx);\n            opacity: 0.85;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           NAVIGATION\n        ============================================ */\n        .nav {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            z-index: 1000;\n            padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n            background: rgba(248, 246, 242, 0.9);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(166, 124, 82, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .nav.hidden {\n            transform: translateY(-100%);\n        }\n\n        .nav-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--color-onyx);\n        }\n\n        .nav-logo span {\n            color: var(--color-bronze);\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--color-onyx);\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover::after {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique) !important;\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            background: var(--color-bronze-dark);\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle span {\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-onyx);\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           HERO SECTION\n        ============================================ */\n        .hero {\n            position: relative;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-2xl);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-ivory-antique) 0%, var(--color-ivory-warm) 100%);\n        }\n\n        .hero-blobs {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .blob {\n            position: absolute;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-patina-1);\n            filter: blur(60px);\n            opacity: 0.4;\n            animation: blob-float 20s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .blob-1 {\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-bronze), var(--color-verdigris));\n            top: 10%;\n            left: -10%;\n            animation-delay: 0s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-patina-1);\n        }\n\n        .blob-2 {\n            width: 350px;\n            height: 350px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-verdigris), var(--color-bronze-light));\n            top: 50%;\n            right: -5%;\n            animation-delay: -5s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-patina-2);\n        }\n\n        .blob-3 {\n            width: 300px;\n            height: 300px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-bronze-patina), var(--color-verdigris-light));\n            bottom: 10%;\n            left: 30%;\n            animation-delay: -10s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-patina-3);\n        }\n\n        .blob-4 {\n            width: 250px;\n            height: 250px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-verdigris-dark), var(--color-bronze-dark));\n            top: 30%;\n            left: 50%;\n            animation-delay: -15s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-patina-4);\n            opacity: 0.25;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes blob-float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);\n            }\n            25% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -30px) rotate(5deg) scale(1.05);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) rotate(-5deg) scale(0.95);\n            }\n            75% {\n                transform: translate(20px, 30px) rotate(3deg) scale(1.02);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .hero-container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: var(--spacing-3xl);\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            opacity: 0;\n            animation: fade-up 0.8s ease forwards;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content h1 {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .hero-content h1 span {\n            color: var(--color-bronze);\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .hero-subtitle {\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n            color: var(--color-onyx);\n            opacity: 0.8;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n            max-width: 500px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-cta {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-bronze-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            background: transparent;\n            color: var(--color-onyx);\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-bronze);\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n        }\n\n        .hero-visual {\n            position: relative;\n            opacity: 0;\n            animation: fade-up 0.8s ease 0.2s forwards;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-patina-1);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);\n        }\n\n        .hero-image {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 500px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-sand), var(--color-ivory-warm));\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -20px;\n            left: -20px;\n            background: var(--color-verdigris);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge h4 {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge p {\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           SECTION STYLES\n        ============================================ */\n        .section {\n            padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-2xl);\n        }\n\n        .section-header h2 {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .section-header p {\n            font-size: 1.125rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: var(--color-verdigris);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           PROBLEM/SOLUTION SECTION\n        ============================================ */\n        .problem-solution {\n            background: var(--color-ivory-warm);\n        }\n\n        .problem-solution-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: var(--spacing-2xl);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card, .solution-card {\n            background: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: var(--spacing-2xl);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: var(--color-onyx);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card:hover, .solution-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-4px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card h3, .solution-card h3 {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .problem-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: var(--color-onyx);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n        }\n\n        .solution-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           SERVICES SECTION\n        ============================================ */\n        .services {\n            background: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n        }\n\n        .services-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            border: 1px solid var(--color-sand);\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .service-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            height: 3px;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-bronze), var(--color-verdigris));\n            transform: scaleX(0);\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover::before {\n            transform: scaleX(1);\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-4px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n            border-color: var(--color-bronze-light);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-bronze), var(--color-verdigris));\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .service-link {\n            color: var(--color-bronze);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .service-link:hover {\n            color: var(--color-bronze-dark);\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           TESTIMONIALS SECTION\n        ============================================ */\n        .testimonials {\n            background: var(--color-verdigris);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials .section-header h2,\n        .testimonials .section-header p {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card {\n            background: rgba(248, 246, 242, 0.1);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(248, 246, 242, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars {\n            color: var(--color-bronze-light);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-text {\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            opacity: 0.95;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-author {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-avatar {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-bronze), var(--color-verdigris-light));\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-name {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-role {\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           DIFFERENTIALS SECTION\n        ============================================ */\n        .differentials {\n            background: var(--color-ivory-warm);\n        }\n\n        .differentials-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon {\n            width: 80px;\n            height: 80px;\n            background: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            position: relative;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -4px;\n            left: -4px;\n            right: -4px;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-bronze);\n            opacity: 0;\n            animation: pulse-ring 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse-ring {\n            0% {\n                transform: scale(1);\n                opacity: 0.5;\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: scale(1.2);\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .differential-item h3 {\n            font-size: 1.125rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item p {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           CONTACT SECTION\n        ============================================ */\n        .contact {\n            background: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n        }\n\n        .contact-container {\n            max-width: 1000px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;\n            gap: var(--spacing-2xl);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info {\n            background: var(--color-verdigris);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info h3 {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .contact-item {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .contact-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: rgba(248, 246, 242, 0.2);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .contact-text p {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n            opacity: 0.95;\n        }\n\n        .contact-text small {\n            font-size: 0.875rem;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        .contact-form {\n            background: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            border: 1px solid var(--color-sand);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .form-label {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-input, .form-select, .form-textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0.875rem 1rem;\n            border: 1px solid var(--color-sand);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n            background: var(--color-ivory-warm);\n        }\n\n        .form-input:focus, .form-select:focus, .form-textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--color-bronze);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(166, 124, 82, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .form-textarea {\n            resize: vertical;\n            min-height: 120px;\n        }\n\n        .form-submit {\n            width: 100%;\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .form-submit:hover {\n            background: var(--color-bronze-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           FOOTER\n        ============================================ */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--color-onyx-deep);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: var(--spacing-2xl) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .footer-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: var(--spacing-2xl);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand h3 {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand p {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links h4 {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            font-size: 1.125rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links ul li {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            opacity: 0.8;\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            opacity: 1;\n            color: var(--color-bronze-light);\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(248, 246, 242, 0.1);\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom p {\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            opacity: 0.7;\n        }\n\n        .footer-social {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .footer-social a {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: rgba(248, 246, 242, 0.1);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            transition: var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .footer-social a:hover {\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           ANIMATIONS\n        ============================================ */\n        @keyframes fade-up {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(30px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-up {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(30px);\n            transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-up.visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           RESPONSIVE DESIGN\n        ============================================ */\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .hero-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-cta {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-image {\n                height: 400px;\n            }\n\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n\n            .testimonials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n\n            .differentials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n\n            .contact-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .footer-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-menu {\n                position: fixed;\n                top: 70px;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n                flex-direction: column;\n                padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n                gap: var(--spacing-md);\n                transform: translateX(100%);\n                transition: var(--transition-base);\n                box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.active {\n                transform: translateX(0);\n            }\n\n            .nav-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .hero {\n                padding: var(--spacing-2xl) var(--spacing-md);\n            }\n\n            .hero-image {\n                height: 300px;\n            }\n\n            .hero-badge {\n                left: 0;\n                bottom: -10px;\n            }\n\n            .problem-solution-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .testimonials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .differentials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .section {\n                padding: var(--spacing-2xl) var(--spacing-md);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            h1 {\n                font-size: 2rem;\n            }\n\n            .hero-subtitle {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .hero-cta {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                width: 100%;\n            }\n\n            .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {\n                width: 100%;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-badge {\n                padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);\n            }\n\n            .hero-badge h4 {\n                font-size: 1.5rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           ACCESSIBILITY\n        ============================================ */\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            *, *::before, *::after {\n                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .skip-link {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -40px;\n            left: 0;\n            background: var(--color-bronze);\n            color: var(--color-ivory-antique);\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            z-index: 1001;\n            transition: top 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .skip-link:focus {\n            top: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Focus visible styles */\n        :focus-visible {\n            outline: 2px solid var(--color-bronze);\n            outline-offset: 2px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link\">Pular para o conteúdo principal</a>\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-logo\">Dra Iara <span>Pengo</span></a>\n            <div class=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"navToggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation menu\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-link\">Início</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"nav-link\">Serviços</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#depoimentos\" class=\"nav-link\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#diferenciais\" class=\"nav-link\">Diferenciais</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contato\" class=\"nav-link\">Contato</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contato\" class=\"nav-link nav-cta\">Agendar Consulta</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-blobs\">\n            <div class=\"blob blob-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"blob blob-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"blob blob-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"blob blob-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-container\">\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <h1>Transforme Sua <span>Beleza Natural</span></h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Atendimento especializado em harmonização facial e estética avançada em Ribeirão Preto. Resultados naturais que realçam sua essência.</p>\n                <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"btn-primary\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                        Agendar Consulta\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"btn-secondary\">\n                        Conhecer Serviços\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-visual\">\n                <div class=\"hero-image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629909613654-28e377c37b09?w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Procedimento estético profissional\" class=\"hero-image\" loading=\"eager\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-badge\">\n                    <h4>+1000</h4>\n                    <p>Clientes Satisfeitas</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Problem/Solution Section -->\n    <section class=\"section problem-solution\" id=\"problema-solucao\">\n        <div class=\"section-header wow-fade-up\">\n            <span class=\"section-tag\">Sua Jornada</span>\n            <h2>Sua Transformação Começa Aqui</h2>\n            <p>Entendemos suas preocupações e oferecemos soluções personalizadas para realçar sua beleza natural.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"problem-solution-grid\">\n            <div class=\"problem-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"0\">\n                <h3>\n                    <span class=\"problem-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2M9 9h.01M15 9h.01\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </span>\n                    O Desafio\n                </h3>\n                <p>Muitas mulheres se sentem inseguras com sinais de envelhecimento, assimetrias faciais ou perda de contorno. A autoestima fica afetada, e a busca por soluções parece complicada.</p>\n                <p>O medo de resultados artificiais e a falta de profissionais qualificados são barreiras comuns na busca pela harmonização facial.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"solution-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"200\">\n                <h3>\n                    <span class=\"solution-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </span>\n                    A Solução\n                </h3>\n                <p>A Dra Iara Pengo oferece uma abordagem personalizada que valoriza suas características únicas. Cada tratamento é desenhado para realçar sua beleza natural.</p>\n                <p>Com técnica apurada e produtos de alta qualidade, alcançamos resultados sutis que rejuvenescem sem perder sua identidade.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"section services\" id=\"servicos\">\n        <div class=\"section-header wow-fade-up\">\n            <span class=\"section-tag\">Tratamentos</span>\n            <h2>Serviços Especializados</h2>\n            <p>Procedimentos avançados com foco em resultados naturais e duradouros.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"0\">\n                <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"/>\n                        <path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Harmonização Facial</h3>\n                <p>Equilíbrio dos traços faciais com preenchedores e toxina botulínica para uma aparência descansada e rejuvenescida.</p>\n                <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                    Saiba mais\n                    <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n                <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Toxina Botulínica</h3>\n                <p>Suaviza linhas de expressão e rugas, prevenindo novos sinais de envelhecimento com resultado natural.</p>\n                <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                    Saiba mais\n                    <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path d=\"M5 12h14M12 